OL,3,GUK long range forecast
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Fri 25 Sep to Sun 4 Oct
OL,6,FAtlantic weather systems will continue
OL,7,Fto bring spells of rain, showers and
OL,8,Foccasional strong winds. The wettest
OL,9,Fand windiest conditions are most
OL,10,Flikely across northern and western
OL,11,Fareas, although wet and windy weather
OL,12,Fmay extend more widely at times.
OL,13,FBetween these unsettled spells,
OL,14,Fperiods of drier and more settled
OL,15,Fweather are likely, especially in the
OL,16,Fsouth and east, where they may last
OL,17,Ffor a few days. Temperatures are
OL,18,Fexpected to be slightly above normal
OL,19,Foverall, but overnight fog and frost
OL,20,Fis possible during clearer, cooler
OL,21,Fnights.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
