OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F163A1789908575
OL,1,Wj5hw1~{4k7juhw1{$             G2/2
OL,2,W+.-'"-$/*%*%*%/"-$/*%Q,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,GUK long range forecast
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Sun 4 Oct to Sun 18 Oct
OL,6,FChangeable and occasionally unsettled
OL,7,Fweather is likely to become more
OL,8,Ffrequent through October, with spells
OL,9,Fof rain and stronger winds
OL,10,Fincreasingly likely to move in from
OL,11,Fthe Atlantic. Between these periods,
OL,12,Fsome drier and brighter interludes are
OL,13,Falso expected. As is often the case
OL,14,Ffor October, deeper areas of low
OL,15,Fpressure may occasionally bring spells
OL,16,Fof very strong winds. Temperatures are
OL,17,Fexpected to remain slightly above
OL,18,Faverage overall, although brief cooler
OL,19,Finterludes are possible.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
